WEBVTT

1
00:00:11.007 --> 00:00:17.583
Jeremy stood on his back legs.

2
00:00:17.584 --> 00:00:21.411
He reached toward the top of the pail.

3
00:00:21.412 --> 00:00:26.533
"Ugh! I am not tall enough!"

4
00:00:26.534 --> 00:00:28.708
Jeremy hopped up.

5
00:00:28.709 --> 00:00:31.467
His fingers reached the rim.

6
00:00:31.468 --> 00:00:34.462
"Yes!" Jeremy said.

7
00:00:34.463 --> 00:00:37.070
But his fingers slipped.

8
00:00:37.071 --> 00:00:37.968
Plop!

9
00:00:37.969 --> 00:00:41.582
Jeremy fell back into the pail.

10
00:00:41.583 --> 00:00:45.619
"What was that sound?" the farmer said.

11
00:00:45.620 --> 00:00:47.579
He looked around.

12
00:00:47.580 --> 00:00:50.386
But he didn't see anything.

13
00:00:50.387 --> 00:00:54.564
The farmer sighed.

14
00:00:54.565 --> 00:00:57.941
He tossed out his line again.

15
00:00:57.942 --> 00:01:01.652
"When will a fish bite?" he said.

16
00:01:01.653 --> 00:01:04.456
Jeremy hopped up again.

17
00:01:04.457 --> 00:01:07.941
This time the pail moved.

18
00:01:07.942 --> 00:01:10.148
Then Jeremy got an idea.

19
00:01:10.149 --> 00:01:12.852
He hopped into the side of the pail.

20
00:01:12.853 --> 00:01:15.431
It rocked.

21
00:01:15.432 --> 00:01:17.433
He hopped harder.

22
00:01:17.434 --> 00:01:20.256
The pail rocked again.

23
00:01:20.257 --> 00:01:23.040
Jeremy hopped one more time.

24
00:01:23.041 --> 00:01:26.589
The pail tipped over!

25
00:01:26.590 --> 00:01:30.208
Jeremy hopped away fast.

26
00:01:30.209 --> 00:01:34.979
Suddenly a big hand grabbed Jeremy.

27
00:01:34.980 --> 00:01:38.793
"A frog!" the farmer growled.

28
00:01:38.794 --> 00:01:44.758
"I hate frogs!"
